	"$comment": "Each family's variants are PhysicalProtocolID.variants in Swift; a family with none has no interface signatures. The parameter names of each family are those its driver declares in ProtocolParameters. defaults holds the sections a record layers over, limited to what the family's driver reads: input applies to hid.report-layout only, a rumble template to the drivers that encode one, startup writes and HID timings to HID families, liveness to sony.dualshock4 and startup recovery to nintendo.switch1.",
